    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d767">

                <pb facs="0788" n="530" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg530"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2084</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The German Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bernstorff</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 1, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: With reference to our
                    conversation of this morning I beg to inform you that my instructions concerning
                    our answer to your last <hi rendition="#italic">Lusitania</hi> note contain the
                    following passage:</p>
                <pb facs="0789" n="531" xml:id="pg531"/>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>Liners will not be sunk by our submarines without warning and without safety
                        of the lives of non-combatants, provided that the liners do not try to
                        escape or offer resistance.</p>
                </quote>
                <p>Although I know that you do not wish to discuss the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Lusitania</hi> question till the <hi rendition="#italic">Arabic</hi>
                    incident has been definitely and satisfactorily settled, I desire to inform you
                    of the above because this policy of my Government was decided on before the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Arabic</hi> incident occurred.</p>
                <p>I have no objection to your making any use you may please of the above
                    information.</p>
                <p>I remain [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Bernstorff</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
